          "eyebrow": "Why teams switch",
          "title": "Everything between the call and the roadmap",
          "intro": "<p>Fieldnote takes care of the busywork of research, so your team spends its time on what customers actually said.</p>",
          "items": [
            {
              "icon": "zap",
              "title": "Transcripts in minutes",
              "text": "Upload a recording or connect your calendar, and get a searchable transcript before your next meeting starts."
